#: ../../../techref/units.md:1
msgid "Dimension and Distance Units"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../techref/units.md:3
msgid ""
"As a geospatial analysis and mapping package, GMT needs to distinguish "
"between two types of units: those used for plotting and those used for "
"geographic distances. The former are called **dimension units** (or plot "
"units) and the latter are called **distance units**."
msgstr ""

